Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:21.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Remember the formations from our training!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.13,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Empress!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.59,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Clay Platoon, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:32.63,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Kassim Platoon, get on the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.15,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Open formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:51.42,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,She's wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:52.19,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:53.78,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:54.65,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:57.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:00:59.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's working just like we did in training!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.45,0:01:00.57,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:05.62,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.41,0:01:10.09,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Initiate long-range attacks once you're \Nsure Clay Platoon has fallen back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.94,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,So they're constantly \Ntargeting her blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:18.04,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:21.47,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,A fine strategy that puts their \Ncollective nature to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:25.77,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,But there's one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:40.62,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Ordinary attacks won't inflict any \Ndamage on a dragon sheathed in scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.27,0:01:43.82,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Well? What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:20.97,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(120.653,77.514)}{\fad(568,1)}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:20.97,sign_4762_23_The_Rosewood_Aca,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(246.477,176.265)}{\fad(568,1)}The Rosewood Academy Training Exercise
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:29.60,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Please bring anyone who's injured this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:31.10,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'll tend to their wounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.65,0:03:41.31,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It seems like you're waiting for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.31,0:03:44.57,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,However, this battle's going \Nto come to an end before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:47.43,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Don't let it hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:50.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.30,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Asmodeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:10.15,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That may have done some paltry damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.15,0:04:12.03,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,but it looks like your plan has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.03,0:04:13.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, it's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Now she's lost awareness of her surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:28.66,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,A pitfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:31.65,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I thought you were fighting fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:34.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It'd be an unfair trap if it \Nhad been set up beforehand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,but that's not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,He dug it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:41.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,After the battle had already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.93,0:04:45.34,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,So you were stalling for time all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.64,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That's not enough to beat her, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:49.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:53.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Our real battle begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:04:59.77,Class- Default,Student,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.47,0:05:02.15,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:06.39,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Asmodeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:08.64,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,As mighty as I may be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:09.12,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:12.16,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Using me repeatedly like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:14.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't be such a wimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:20.30,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Leonard, can you keep fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.67,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:29.64,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Leonard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.09,0:05:33.42,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,I've still got stamina to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:37.24,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,I haven't failed to run those ten kilometers \Nyou asked of me every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:39.03,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I said what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:39.65,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:44.11,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,She's about to take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:46.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:48.66,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:49.66,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:54.41,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:59.42,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power: \NGravity Manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Now, Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:12.93,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you're working us to the bone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:18.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I command thee in the \Nname of Earnest Flaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:21.56,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,O sword! Demonstrate thy power!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.69,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,No more... Pwease!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:27.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:34.51,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Who knew we had such a\N capable student at our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:36.46,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's not just her powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:41.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Even in the advanced class, there aren't \Nmany who can hone their fighting spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:42.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:45.25,Class- Default,Boy Student C,0,0,0,,Even us students in the lower classes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.63,Class- Default,Girl Student A,0,0,0,,Can serve as conduits...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.32,Class- Default,Girl Student B,0,0,0,,To gather power from everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:50.68,Class- Default,Girl Student C,0,0,0,,We also...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:53.13,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Want to be friends with Cu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.92,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Please, Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:58.56,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Grant strength to my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:06:59.47,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:01.25,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,It's in your hands, Empress!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:02.81,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Get her good, Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:04.15,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:15.16,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Go forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:16.99,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Get a good look, Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.49,0:07:19.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,This is what humans can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:46.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:49.52,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I ended up losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.71,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I disappointed you, Parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:57.38,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Weak children get abandoned, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:59.15,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:03.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Besides, you're wrong about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:05.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's not that you were weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.37,0:08:09.16,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Humans were just stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:13.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well? Will you admit it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:15.33,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:18.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Does that mean you can be friends with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:26.06,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I-I suppose I must, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:27.93,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I don't mind becoming friends with—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:28.97,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:30.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You know that's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:33.45,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.86,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,P-Please... be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:41.95,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Be friends with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:48.29,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:55.86,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Let's get along, Cu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.57,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.41,Class- Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Hey, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.73,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,I see you're in high spirits, Gil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.66,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,What are you scheming this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:11.42,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see my students grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:15.74,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Since they can harness their fighting \Nspirit and spiritual energy now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:19.74,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I've arranged a training method\Nthat's even more hands-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:21.74,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,By which you mean that device?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:22.88,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:28.75,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It's called virtual reality, made using a \Nonce-lost branch of magic called science.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:33.04,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I eagerly await its completion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:43.56,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Cu, Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:45.34,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Okay, open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:48.90,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I-I can feed myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.99,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,In that case, are you \Ngoing to sit by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.30,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Here, open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:58.82,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:02.75,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:04.64,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Now, c'mere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:05.79,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Sit here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:06.95,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:09.33,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You sure are demanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:13.18,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So cute! So adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:14.71,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Cuddle, cuddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:18.40,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Claire, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.40,0:10:19.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, Earnest...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:23.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Is there something different about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:24.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:26.64,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:27.93,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:29.74,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,C'mon, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:32.48,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You can't say that, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:35.02,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You truly are despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:39.08,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Um... You really haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:40.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.37,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You've totally changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:45.14,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Pay him no mind, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:47.08,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Your rotund self is just as lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:51.77,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It was your weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.77,0:10:53.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You got fat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:56.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I {\i1}thought{\i0} you'd gotten bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:58.04,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I-I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.33,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Do you really need to rub it in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:02.93,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.68,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:07.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:10.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I was in the wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:13.01,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised \Nif you two were through!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:14.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Through?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:21.70,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,There, there, Parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:24.99,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Blade's really taking it hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:28.70,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Well, it's been three days since \NAnna locked herself in her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:34.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Who knew that being "through"\Nmeant I couldn't see her anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:35.50,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:36.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:38.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So what does "through" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:44.22,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,It's like, "We can't be friends anymore!\NWe're through being friends!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:45.84,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:48.34,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No! I don't want that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:51.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I wanna stay friends with Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:54.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Will she forgive me if I apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:55.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll go and say sorry to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:56.94,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:12:01.22,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Blade, you don't know why \NAnna's mad at you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:05.14,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You're only going to make her angrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:07.88,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.49,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,That's why we'll tag along as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:13.67,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm worried about how Anna's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.67,0:12:15.83,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,And because we're friends, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:16.89,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.59,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:24.84,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Are you free?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.35,0:12:28.68,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Blade's here to apologize \Nfor what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.85,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Anna, I'm opening the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.35,0:12:47.37,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:49.34,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:50.51,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:52.37,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Can we come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:58.84,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Looks tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:01.87,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Let me have some, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.87,0:13:03.58,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You've got so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.87,0:13:03.58,Class - Top,Yessica,0,0,0,,Hey, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:05.29,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You can spare some of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:05.29,Class - Top,Yessica,0,0,0,,Cu, you can see like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:06.34,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:06.34,Class - Top,Claire,0,0,0,,Someone turn on the lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:10.74,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,D-Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:14.35,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Please, don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.23,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,These desserts are so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:17.41,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,These desserts...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:19.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So that's the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.75,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Ever since our fight against Cu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:25.35,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I started feeling hungry all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:26.68,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.13,0:13:31.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I never realized before that all \Nof this delicious food existed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, Earnest...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:35.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let me ask you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:38.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Are you and I through as friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.19,0:13:39.38,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:43.64,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I didn't... want you to see me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:46.06,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So I couldn't bear to talk with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:48.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So we aren't through, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:51.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:52.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:53.73,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.93,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:58.88,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,If you leave now, Anna's \Ngonna end up a lost cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.18,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Something nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:02.86,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You need to say something nice, or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:04.82,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Something nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Enjoying those desserts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:10.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:12.96,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:14.80,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You're twisting the knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:15.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:17.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What should I say, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:19.77,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Leonard, show him how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:20.79,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:25.07,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,My lord, I remain tirelessly devoted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.70,0:14:28.22,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,No matter how overweight you may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:31.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Who are you calling overweight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:33.14,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:37.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,This isn't something you \Ncan deal with alone, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:40.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If not, then turn to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,All of us will help you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:43.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What you need is training!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:46.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.05,0:14:56.20,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Okay! I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:59.24,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, stop eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Should we go a little slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.53,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If it doesn't hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:17.18,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I won't be burning calories!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:19.09,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Step, step, step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:20.20,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,19!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:20.88,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You're doing great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.88,0:15:22.00,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,20!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.88,0:15:24.02,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I'm here to cheer you on as your friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.02,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,21!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:24.86,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Step, step, step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:26.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay! Keep it up, Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:27.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There! Push harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:28.15,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:30.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Step, step, step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:39.25,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I had the kitchen prepare a\N special meal, just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.86,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh? That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.86,0:15:42.73,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:45.66,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You need to cut your calorie intake as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:49.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:55.10,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,The water feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:26.10,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How come it hasn't gone down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:28.16,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Yikes, that ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:29.71,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,This won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:32.22,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It almost feels like it's gone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:34.83,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.22,sign_23790_268_THUD,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,685)\move(321.99,184.199,320,17.79,21,4000)}{\blur1\3c&H2A1271&}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:36.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:38.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,How's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:41.04,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't peek!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:46.86,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,You're a real hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:48.64,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:49.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:51.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:53.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:54.02,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:59.09,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You know, Anna, you should have \Nput on some muscle from training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.09,0:17:00.96,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll slim down in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.41,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:03.73,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:08.50,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,If only there were an easier way \Nto raise your metabolic rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:14.17,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I wanted to try something a\N little more drastic today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.67,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Something drastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:18.21,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:24.24,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,This is Testing Ground No. 2, and it's\N protected by a powerful magic barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:26.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,so there shouldn't be any casualties,\N even if this goes wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:29.90,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:32.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If I can pull this off and lose weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.71,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,can you praise me for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.71,0:17:37.39,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:45.83,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you if \Nanything happens, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:47.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:52.40,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I command thee in the \Nname of Earnest Flaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:54.50,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,O sword! Consume my flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:56.61,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Use it as thy power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:10.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:23.70,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,This is where you two were!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:26.04,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Wait, what {\i1}is{\i0} that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:28.03,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that Earnest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.03,0:18:29.85,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What? Anna?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:32.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Stay calm. Have faith in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:33.11,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Still!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.60,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.60,0:18:45.81,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But man, that was scorching hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:47.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:48.71,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Verily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:51.86,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Thy flesh hath now perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:54.43,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:56.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Asmodeus, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:58.21,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Hold thy head high with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.21,0:19:03.62,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,'Tis not since thy first ancestor \Nthat one hath attained this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:06.87,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,What happened to Earnest's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:11.95,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Succumbed flesh doth become \Nflame by mine hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:17.61,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,An undying body,\Nwholly immune to attacks physical!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:19.43,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:23.26,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Where is thy nemesis, worthy of this form?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:26.64,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Show me thy foe to set ablaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.82,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,My foe to set ablaze...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:30.89,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That would be my body fat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:31.59,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:35.60,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Because I did this all for my diet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:36.98,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Diet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.86,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm burning so much energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:42.16,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It must use up a ton many calories!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:44.04,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I-Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:48.85,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,The drawback to this demon form lies \Nwith the enormous energy it consumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:52.17,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,Maintaining this form requires \None million calories every hour...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:54.67,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,One million!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:58.51,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Who's got time to slowly \Njog off those pounds?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:00.82,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Just burn it all away in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:02.98,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:07.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:10.11,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I think I'm at my limit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:13.14,sign_23790_268_THUD,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(173,929)\c&HFEB4A9&\3c&H707070&\fs20\move(172.104,285.636,-2.984,284.973,6,1500)}Grooooowl
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.14,0:20:15.41,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:16.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:21.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm... hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:26.00,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,She's gone into some kind of beast mode?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.58,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She grew a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:30.70,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Anna! Don't abandon your humanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:33.52,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.02,0:20:34.98,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.48,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,She said my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:37.73,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Claire...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:39.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Looks tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Series, Third Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.01,0:20:51.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Banish!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:53.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wind pressure-only version.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.27,0:21:23.13,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:26.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:38.85,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:40.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:42.46,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So you're eating again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:45.07,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I-It's fine, y'see!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:49.20,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If I turn into a flame demon,\NI can lose it again in no time! Y'see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:50.41,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Y'see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:52.44,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,That's an excuse for losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:53.93,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I said it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.93,0:21:55.42,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's fine, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.42,0:21:57.71,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:21:59.88,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.88,0:22:02.78,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Dieting is the best!
